            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye haba ugutaka gukomeye, abantu n’abagore babo bidodombera bene wabo b’Abayuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bati Twe n’abahungu bacu n’abakobga bacu turi benshi; ni muduhe ibidutunga turye kugira ngo tubeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi baravuga, bat’ Amatongo yacu n’inzabibu zacu n’amazu yacu tubitangakw ingwati kugira ngo turonke ibidutunga bizodutsindira ikigoyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.4.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 4:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n’abandi baravuga, bati Twagwatirije amatongo n’inzabibu zacu kugira ngo batugurāne amahera y’ikori ry’umwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 21:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 25:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamara rero, imibiri yacu n’ imwe n’iya bene wacu, kand’ abana bacu ni bamwe n’ababo; kand’ ehe rāba abahungu bacu n’abakobga bacu turiko turabata mu buja. Mbere bamwe bo mu bakobga bacu baramaze kubushikamwo, kandi twabuze uko tugira, kukw amatongo yacu n’inzabibu zacu bimaze kujanwa n’abandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
