                  "text": "2 Tes 3:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uhereye umusi umwami Aritazeruzi yangize icēgēra ciwe mu gihugu c’i Buyuda, kuva ku mwaka ugira mirongwibiri kugeza ku mwaka ugira mirongwitatu n’ibiri ari ku ngoma, ukw ar’ imyaka cumi n’ibiri, ari jewe ari bene wacu, nta ho twigeze dutungwa n’amarari yagerewe icēgēra c’umwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw abanyitangiye imbere mu gutwarira umwami, bāraruhije abantu, kuko bāgenda babatoza ivyo kurya na vino, hamwe na shekeli z’ifeza mirongwine; mbere n’abasavyi babo bagatwaza abantu amanyama. Ariko jewe sinigeze ngenza ntyo, kuko nubaha Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko nagize umwete wo gukora, nubaka urwo ruzitiro; nta tongo na rimwe twaguze, kandi n’abantu banje bose bāma bakoranira kur’ ico gikorwa. ",
          "type": "text",
